=== or_choose_02 ===
Or: We need fine sand for polishing. Will you take the bucket and stream map?
The landing by the bridge is another place to ask for directions.
* [Use the map and search alone # item:or_02 # pick:a]
* [Ask the fishers and merchants on the bridge # item:or_02 # pick:b]
-
-> END

=== or_choose_03 ===
The gears on the clock tower board are connected.
Or: Which weight shall we attach?
* [Use a light weight to protect the gears # item:or_03 # pick:a]
* [Use a heavy weight for a stronger chime # item:or_03 # pick:b]
-
-> END

=== or_choose_04 ===
The workshop apprentice unfolds a separate lantern lift diagram.
Or: How shall we study this complicated diagram?
* [Talk through it together # item:or_04 # pick:a]
* [Study it quietly on your own first # item:or_04 # pick:b]
