-> END

=== or_choose_05 ===
There is a little time left to improve the iron lantern hanger for the square. New branches on both sides would hold twice as many lanterns; reinforcing the joint would support heavier ones.
* [Add a branch to hold more lanterns # item:or_05 # pick:a]
* [Reinforce the base for heavy lanterns # item:or_05 # pick:b]
-
-> END

=== or_choose_06 ===
The forge work is done and the fire has died down. The tools can be wiped and hung up, or the finished bell can be carried to the square.
Or: Thanks for your help. What shall we do now?
* [Stay and enjoy the quiet warmth # item:or_06 # pick:a]
* [Bring the bell to the square and talk with everyone # item:or_06 # pick:b]
-
-> END

